{"id":"comunicacio_n","lemma":"comunicación","pos":"noun","rank":2007,"glosses":["communication"],"ipa":"/komunikaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"comunicaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-comunicaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La comunicación es buena.","en":"Communication is good.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"}]},{"text":"No hay progreso sin comunicación.","en":"There is no progress without communication.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061867","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"progress"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"La lengua es una herramienta de comunicación.","en":"Language is a means of communication.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306384","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"tongue"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"a tool, an implement"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Lo que cambia el mundo es la comunicación, no la información.","en":"What changes the world is communication, not information.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733102","words":[null,null,{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"world, earth"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"information, data"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"De repente se cortó toda comunicación con el avión.","en":"All communication with that airplane was suddenly cut off.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733692","words":[null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to cut","l":"cortar"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"aeroplane"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"suddenly"]]}]}